        "slc_e8a1ceca73b033510a46dd86c012b61efa46440bb8b20f2c7b75669215028b2e"
      ],
      "text": "Core features include technology-agnostic code generation from data plus templates, evolvable data models with checkpoint and diff support, an extensible DAG task engine based on cue/flow, and LLM-assisted chat combined with code generation."
    },
